@untreu2 @realmeylisdev I’m not a Linux user, and I currently have a lot of other open tasks. If either of you wants to take over this task, feel free to self-assign it. Otherwise, I’ll handle it asap but most important here is to test it on Linux.

Note that this is actually a important task because once we implement this part, we can completely remove MediaKit and all the duplicated code (home-feed and explore-feed don't share mostly the same widgets even it does the same) which should make it a lot easier for us to fix issues in the main-feed.

cc @NotThatKindOfDrLiz

